---
---

<section data-testid="research" id="research" class="py-10 lg:py-14">

	<p class="mb-2 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-orange">02 — Research</p>
	<h2 class="mb-3 font-monospace text-2xl text-black dark:text-white lg:text-4xl">
		How we learned what users actually need
	</h2>
	<p class="mb-8 max-w-xl text-sm leading-loose text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">
		8 semi-structured interviews with Chinese immigrants living in Seattle (1–10 years in the US).
		Sessions were in-person and via Zoom. Participants lived alone or had limited social networks.
	</p>

	<!-- Affinity diagram -->
	<div class="mb-8 flex justify-center">
		<figure class="w-full max-w-2xl">
			<img
				src="/images/palup/affinity_diagram.png"
				alt="Affinity diagram clustering 6 major themes from interview data"
				class="w-full rounded-2xl shadow ring-1 ring-black/5"
				loading="lazy"
			/>
			<figcaption class="mt-2 text-center text-xs text-gray-400">
				Affinity diagram — 6 major themes clustered from interview data
			</figcaption>
		</figure>
	</div>

	<!-- Key themes grid — 4 columns -->
	<div class="mb-8 grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">
		<div class="rounded-xl border border-gray-100 bg-white p-4 shadow-sm dark:border-gray-800 dark:bg-gray-900">
			<p class="mb-1 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-orange">Theme 1</p>
			<p class="mb-1 text-sm font-semibold text-black dark:text-white">Conversation &gt; Cuisine</p>
			<p class="text-xs leading-relaxed text-gray-500">
				Conversational fit was consistently prioritized over food preferences when evaluating potential companions.
			</p>
		</div>
		<div class="rounded-xl border border-gray-100 bg-white p-4 shadow-sm dark:border-gray-800 dark:bg-gray-900">
			<p class="mb-1 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-orange">Theme 2</p>
			<p class="mb-1 text-sm font-semibold text-black dark:text-white">Group Size Matters</p>
			<p class="text-xs leading-relaxed text-gray-500">
				4 people was cited as ideal — small enough to talk meaningfully, large enough to reduce awkward silences.
			</p>
		</div>
		<div class="rounded-xl border border-gray-100 bg-white p-4 shadow-sm dark:border-gray-800 dark:bg-gray-900">
			<p class="mb-1 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-orange">Theme 3</p>
			<p class="mb-1 text-sm font-semibold text-black dark:text-white">Safety Is a Prerequisite</p>
			<p class="text-xs leading-relaxed text-gray-500">
				Trust mechanisms were non-negotiable for female participants — safety was expected, not a bonus feature.
			</p>
		</div>
		<div class="rounded-xl border border-gray-100 bg-white p-4 shadow-sm dark:border-gray-800 dark:bg-gray-900">
			<p class="mb-1 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-orange">Theme 4</p>
			<p class="mb-1 text-sm font-semibold text-black dark:text-white">The Bad Cycle</p>
			<p class="text-xs leading-relaxed text-gray-500">
				Fewer friends → less dining out → harder to meet people. A self-reinforcing loop the app needed to break.
			</p>
		</div>
	</div>

	<!-- Persona -->
	<div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-6 lg:flex-row lg:items-start lg:gap-10">
		<div class="lg:w-1/3">
			<p class="mb-2 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-orange">User Persona</p>
			<p class="mb-2 font-monospace text-xl font-bold text-black dark:text-white">Angela Zhang</p>
			<p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">
				28 · Software Engineer · Seattle. Loves communal dining, struggles to find compatible companions without it feeling like a date.
			</p>
		</div>
		<div class="flex justify-center lg:w-2/3">
			<img
				src="/images/palup/persona.png"
				alt="User persona card for Angela Zhang"
				class="w-full max-w-xl rounded-2xl shadow ring-1 ring-black/5"
				loading="lazy"
			/>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>
